  _question: 'Thomas released someone before they could be sanctified. What do you
    do? '
  _inverseQuestion: 'Thomas released someone before they could be sanctified. What
    do you <color=red>not</color> do? '
  _answerRight: Add Thomas to the sanctification list. His blood debt must be paid.
